{
  "key": "letter-008-part-01",
  "number": 8,
  "generationId": "01a1e4e1-88cd-7a9b-b6da-979691da0fa3",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "My respects to you.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.100952
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Moving around for the whole of May affected my health so all programs for June - Bombay, Calcutta, Jaipur - were canceled.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.473356,
      "end": 11.045736999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I am glad to hear you are experimenting with samadhi yoga.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/03.mp3",
      "start": 12.407302000000001,
      "end": 15.436689
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Don't worry about results, just be with the experimenting.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/04.mp3",
      "start": 16.953107,
      "end": 20.382063000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The return is bound to come one day - not gradually but all of a sudden, effortlessly, without one's knowing, it happens.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/05.mp3",
      "start": 21.710862,
      "end": 30.258821
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Within a moment life becomes wonderfully different!",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/06.mp3",
      "start": 31.636871,
      "end": 34.613696
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I am not writing anything on Bhagwan Mahavir at the moment.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/07.mp3",
      "start": 35.909501000000006,
      "end": 39.165963999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "There is no urge whatsoever in me to write.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/08.mp3",
      "start": 40.611973000000006,
      "end": 43.781155999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "But if you persuade me it is a different thing!",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/09.mp3",
      "start": 45.256576,
      "end": 48.064059
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Everything else is fine.",
      "path": "audio/1963-08/10.mp3",
      "start": 49.520544,
      "end": 51.12
    }
  ]
}
